    modified_response: "I will create `/src/components/ChatbotSimulator.tsx` to handle both Chatbot operational custom rules and the Live Chatbot Simulator on a side-by-side split screen. On the left, it contains settings forms for tone of voice, assistant name, custom rules, and visualization guidelines. On the right, it implements an active chat window connected to the server-side Gemini API gateway, which feeds the customized rules and active catalog into the system prompt for robust grounding. It also features a custom high-fidelity markdown-to-element parser that visually displays product card previews, buy buttons, and images with absolute fidelity."
